msgid "Module for creating and customizing reports across all system modules."
msgstr "Modul untuk membuat dan menyesuaikan laporan di seluruh modul sistem."

msgid ""
"Seed default CRM reports and extend the engine to load them. Add an empty "
"state for report filters and refresh report-detail navbar button styles. "
"Store relative referer URLs with a full-nav fallback from report detail."
msgstr ""
"Buat laporan CRM default dan perluas mesin untuk memuatnya.Tambahkan status "
"kosong untuk filter laporan dan segarkan gaya tombol bilah navigasi detail "
"laporan.Simpan URL perujuk relatif dengan penggantian navigasi lengkap dari "
"detail laporan."

msgid ""
"Gate report export through export permissions and get_export_queryset / "
"is_exportable_field helpers."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor laporan gerbang melalui izin ekspor dan pembantu get_export_queryset "
"/ is_exportable_field."

msgid ""
"Avoid RelatedObjectDoesNotExist in create-report form_invalid when related "
"objects are missing."
msgstr ""
"Hindari TerkaitObjectDoesNotExist di buat-laporan form_invalid ketika objek "
"terkait hilang."

msgid ""
"Re-raise HttpNotFound with exception chaining in report detail, export, and "
"CRUD views to preserve context."
msgstr ""
"Naikkan kembali HttpNotFound dengan rangkaian pengecualian dalam detail "
"laporan, ekspor, dan tampilan CRUD untuk menjaga konteks."

msgid ""
"Added pivot cell active state and filter badge with clear action. Fixed "
"detail table filtering for empty and null pivot group values."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan status aktif sel pivot dan lencana filter dengan tindakan yang "
"jelas.Memperbaiki pemfilteran tabel detail untuk nilai grup pivot kosong dan"
" nol."

msgid ""
"Removed redundant fields attributes superseded by form_class on report CRUD "
"views, standardized first-party import groups, and added docstrings for "
"pylint compliance."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus atribut bidang berlebihan yang digantikan oleh form_class pada "
"tampilan CRUD laporan, grup impor pihak pertama yang distandarisasi, dan "
"menambahkan docstrings untuk kepatuhan pylint."

msgid ""
"Report forms aligned with ModelForm layout: field_order and Meta.fields = "
"\"__all__\" with Meta.exclude; folder and column HTMX unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Formulir laporan selaras dengan tata letak ModelForm: field_order dan "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\" dengan Meta.exclude;folder dan kolom HTML tidak "
"berubah."

msgid ""
"Release 1.10: reports ship under contrib with app label reports. Cross-app "
"report wiring, ContentType references, namespaces, and registrations updated"
" for the contrib naming scheme."
msgstr ""
"Rilis 1.10: laporan dikirimkan berdasarkan kontribusi dengan laporan label "
"aplikasi.Pengkabelan laporan lintas aplikasi, referensi ContentType, "
"namespace, dan registrasi diperbarui untuk skema penamaan kontrib."

msgid ""
"Improved report compatibility with dashboard multi-widget support, enhanced "
"chart_value_field handling, and minor stability improvements for report "
"rendering and filter processing."
msgstr ""
"Peningkatan kompatibilitas laporan dengan dukungan multi-widget dasbor, "
"penanganan bidang_nilai_grafik yang ditingkatkan, dan sedikit peningkatan "
"stabilitas untuk rendering laporan dan pemrosesan filter."

msgid ""
"Added support for advanced chart types including Treemap, Area charts, "
"Heatmaps, Sankey diagrams, and Radar charts. Improved compatibility with the"
" new visualization and analytics framework."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan dukungan untuk tipe bagan tingkat lanjut termasuk Peta Hierarki,"
" Bagan Area, Peta Panas, Diagram Sankey, dan Bagan Radar.Peningkatan "
"kompatibilitas dengan kerangka visualisasi dan analitik baru."

msgid ""
"Migrated from AppConfig to AppLauncher and and replacedutilities with "
"utils.decorators, utils.translation,and shortcuts where applicable."
msgstr ""
"Bermigrasi dari AppConfig ke AppLauncher dan mengganti utilitas dengan "
"utils.decorators, utils.translation, dan pintasan jika memungkinkan."

